# Copy to .env and replace every value. Never commit .env.
# Service tokens are for services only and at least 32 bytes
# (e.g. `openssl rand -base64 33`); rotate them by replacing and restarting.
# Reviewers sign in with Solid-OIDC and agents carry capability tokens, so there
# is no reviewer or agent token (ROADMAP phase 2).
ADMIN_TOKEN=
REGISTRAR_TOKEN=
ENGINE_TOKEN=
# The people provisioned in assets-css, as name:role[+role], comma-separated.
# Roles: author, reviewer. Default: author:author,reviewer:reviewer.
# ASSETS_PEOPLE=alice:author,bob:reviewer
